{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_07_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "91789eb9212a71f518e28bac74e54824aa595f146fda0dd972be406224ec3ce6", "ja": "もう、知ってるわよ！　{$P$}くんの\n熱～い視線、私、感じちゃったもの。ウフフ♪", "zh": "真是的，我知道啦！\n我可是感受到了{$P$}你那火～辣的视线哦。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_07_1010_046rio", "source_sha256": "4d2f4cc78c0e62a7a0804252785a799dd984a15c606e11b94a8b5a4351b51218", "ja": "それにしても、こんなに楽しいお酒は久しぶりね♪\nはあ、詩花ちゃんも早く大人にならないかなぁ～。", "zh": "话说回来，这么开心地喝酒，真是好久没有过了呢♪\n唉，诗花也快点长大就好了呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_07_1011_p", "source_sha256": "b7a7f1586fd14ce0390f4b314406655d38437f55bab0a9b9e33e2ce0a57d6a7e", "ja": "まだ高校生だからな。詩花との打ち上げは、\nまた別の機会を考えるから、その時に。", "zh": "她现在还是高中生嘛。和诗花的庆功宴，\n之后我会另找机会考虑的，到时候再说吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
